===A3_S4_D1===
// attached to the calf that’s behind one of the doors
Calf: Thank you! I was stuck in here all day…
Narrator: You learn that the calf went on a late-night walk after everyone fell asleep, but due to the strong winds, he’d gotten spooked by the rustle of the trees 
Narrator: and eventually ended up here, huddling for shelter… until the door locked in.
Calf: I guess it wasn’t <i>all</i> bad… There’s a pretty good view of the stars at night.
Narrator: He’s obviously trying to maintain a calm facade, but you and Amelia share a glance.
Chione: Wait…! Is your hoof alright? #portrait:ChioneHm
Narrator: Chione kneels down to inspect the calf’s right hindleg, which he’s been lifting off the ground a little.
Calf: Ah… I did try to kick the door open. It’s just a little sore.
Chione: We’ll make you a splint. It’ll help take some pressure off. #portrait:ChioneNormal
Noelle: There should be enough branches and vines lying around. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Noelle: We’ll be right back! #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
